# Amharic & Multilingual Document Conversion Architecture

## Overview

የፕሮጀክታችን ዋና ዓላማ ፈጣን ብቻ የሆነ conversion service መፍጠር ሳይሆን፣ ተጠቃሚዎች ከservice መጀመር በኋላ የሚያገኙት ልምድ የተረጋጋ (stable), ታማኝ (reliable) እና ሊያድግ የሚችል (scalable) እንዲሆን ማድረግ ነው።

Amharic document support የፕሮጀክቱ አስፈላጊ ክፍል ሲሆን English እና ሌሎች ቋንቋዎችንም ለመደገፍ የሚችል architecture ይኖረዋል።

---

# 1. Normal Document Conversion

Normal document conversion ማለት ፋይሉ ውስጥ ጽሑፉ በቀጥታ የሚገኝ (selectable text) ሲሆን ነው።

Examples:

* Amharic Unicode documents
* English documents
* Mixed Amharic + English documents

Supported conversions:

* PDF → Word
* Word → PDF
* PDF → Excel
* Compression
* Lock / Unlock
* Other document processing features

Architecture:

```
User Upload

↓

Document Analyzer

↓

Text-based Document

↓

LibreOffice Conversion Engine

↓

Output File
```

---

# 2. Amharic Unicode Support

Amharic Unicode documents በትክክል ለመቀየር:

* Unicode text handling
* Proper font support
* Character encoding management

ይጠበቃል።

Normal Amharic Unicode documents:

```
Amharic Text PDF

↓

Text Extraction

↓

Conversion

↓

Word / PDF Output
```

በመደበኛ conversion engine ሊሰሩ ይችላሉ።

---

# 3. Scanned Document Conversion

Scanned PDF የተለየ ሂደት ይፈልጋል።

ምክንያቱም scanned PDF ውስጥ ጽሑፍ አይኖርም፤ image ብቻ ሊሆን ይችላል።

Architecture:

```
Scanned PDF

↓

Image Processing

↓

OCR Engine

↓

Text Recognition

↓

Document Reconstruction

↓

Conversion Engine

↓

Output File
```

---

# 4. OCR Scope

OCR ለሚከተሉት ያገለግላል:

* Scanned Amharic documents
* Scanned English documents
* Image-based PDFs
* Old document processing

OCR ዋና ተግባሩ:

Image → Text Recognition

ነው።

ነገር ግን conversion ላይ ብቻውን አይበቃም።

የሚያስፈልገው:

* Text recognition
* Paragraph reconstruction
* Table recognition
* Layout preservation

ነው።

---

# 5. Amharic Conversion Challenges

## A. Old Amharic Fonts

አንዳንድ የቆዩ Amharic documents:

* Legacy fonts
* Non-Unicode encoding

ሊጠቀሙ ይችላሉ።

Potential solution:

```
Font Detection

↓

Encoding Conversion

↓

Unicode Text

↓

Document Conversion
```

---

## B. Scanned Amharic OCR

Scanned Amharic OCR ትልቁ ፈተና ነው።

ምክንያቶች:

* Limited training data compared with English
* Different fonts
* Image quality
* Complex characters
* Layout restoration

Solution:

OCR improvement + testing + user feedback.

---

# 6. English vs Amharic OCR

English OCR በአብዛኛው የበሰለ ሲሆን:

* More training data
* More years of development
* Wider usage

አለው።

ግን English scanned documents ላይም:

* Poor scans
* Tables
* Handwriting
* Old documents

ችግር ሊኖር ይችላል።

Amharic scanned OCR ደግሞ ተጨማሪ ማሻሻያ እና testing ይፈልጋል።

---

# 7. Final Conversion Architecture

System ሁሉንም document ወደ OCR አይልክም።

የተለያዩ paths ይኖራሉ።

```
User Upload

↓

Document Analyzer

↓

Is Text Document?

        YES                    NO

        ↓                      ↓

Normal Conversion        OCR Pipeline

        ↓                      ↓

        └──────────┬───────────┘

                   ↓

          Final Conversion

                   ↓

          Temporary File

                   ↓

             Auto Delete
```

---

# 8. Technology Decision

## Core Conversion Engine

LibreOffice:

* Open source
* Server compatible
* Stable conversion
* Supports major document formats

## OCR Layer

Separate service layer:

* Only used when needed
* Does not slow down normal conversions
* Can be improved independently

---

# Final Principle

Normal conversions must remain:

* Fast
* Stable
* Reliable

Advanced processing (OCR, scanned documents, old fonts) runs as an intelligent layer without affecting the normal text-conversion path.

The goal is not only to launch quickly, but to build a reliable document platform that can grow over time.
